{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13435","headline":"五丝 · 褚朝阳","name":"五丝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越人传楚俗，截竹竞萦丝。\n水底深休也，日中远贺之。\n章施文胜质，列匹美於姬。\n锦绣侔新段，羔羊寝旧诗。\n但夸端午节，谁荐屈原祠。\n把酒时伸奠，汨罗空远而。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚朝阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}